' Change 1662: no #option StartupMethodsDisabled.
' Expected (build 1662): "call INITSYS" at the start and the INITSYS routine compiled: the same asm as build 1661.
' (No Random here: InitRandom's seed is made at compile time, so every compile would differ.)
#chip 18F46J50, 48
#option explicit

Dir PORTB Out
Do
    PORTB = PORTB + 1
    Wait 100 ms
Loop
